### Finance Control API — testes manuais (REST Client / VS Code / Rider)
### Suba a API antes: `dotnet run --launch-profile http`
### Substitua os GUIDs abaixo pelos valores retornados nas respostas.

@host = http://localhost:5056
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@categoryId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@paymentMethodId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@transactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

### --- Meios de pagamento: listar ---
GET {{host}}/api/PaymentMethods

### --- Contas: listar ---
GET {{host}}/api/Account?page=1&pageSize=100

### --- Contas: criar ---
POST {{host}}/api/Account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta teste HTTP",
  "initialBalance": 100.00,
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "isActive": true
}

### --- Contas: obter por id ---
GET {{host}}/api/Account/{{accountId}}

### --- Contas: atualizar ---
PUT {{host}}/api/Account/{{accountId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "name": "Conta teste HTTP (editada)",
  "initialBalance": 100.00,
  "currentBalance": 150.50,
  "isActive": true
}

### --- Categorias: listar ---
GET {{host}}/api/Category?page=1&pageSize=100

### --- Categorias: registrar ---
POST {{host}}/api/Category/registerCategory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Teste API",
  "categoryDescription": "Categoria criada pelo .http",
  "icon": "shopping_cart",
  "isActive": true
}

### --- Categorias: atualizar ---
PUT {{host}}/api/Category/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "categoryName": "Teste API (editada)",
  "description": "Descrição atualizada",
  "icon": "shopping_cart",
  "isActive": true
}

### --- Transações: listar ---
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction?page=1&pageSize=100&userId={{userId}}

### --- Transações: criar (transactionTypeKind: 1=Receita, 2=Despesa) ---
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionDescription": "Compra teste",
  "transactionValue": 25.90,
  "date": "2026-05-04T15:00:00Z",
  "transactionTypeKind": 2,
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### --- Transações: obter por id ---
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction/{{transactionId}}

### --- Transações: atualizar ---
PUT {{host}}/api/Transaction/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "{{transactionId}}",
  "transactionDescription": "Compra teste (editada)",
  "transactionValue": 30.00,
  "date": "2026-05-04T16:00:00Z",
  "transactionTypeKind": 2,
  "paymentMethodId": "{{paymentMethodId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}"
}

### --- Transações: excluir ---
DELETE {{host}}/api/Transaction/{{transactionId}}

### --- Usuários: listar ---
GET {{host}}/User?page=1&pageSize=100

### --- Usuários: login ---
POST {{host}}/User/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester.api@example.com",
  "password": "Senha1234!"
}

### --- Usuários: registrar (senha mín. 8 caracteres) ---
POST {{host}}/User/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "Tester API",
  "email": "tester.api@example.com",
  "password": "Senha1234!",
  "profilePhoto": ""
}
